# PROVIDES the face builder the console picker offers as "Edit Face".
#
# A runtime twin of `provides`: the picker declares `default shared CREW_AVATAR_EDITOR =
# False` and builds the button only behind this, so a mission that does not load this addon
# simply has no button. Order-safe whichever top level runs first, because the other side is
# a `default`. Deliberately NOT a compile-time `requires` on the picker - a hard dependency
# on an addon most missions do not load is how LM's hangar took twenty-two missions to zero
# labels, the `sbs create` template included.
provides crew.avatar_editor
shared CREW_AVATAR_EDITOR = True

import avatar_editor.mast
